# --- dependencies ---
**/node_modules/
**/.pnp
**/.pnp.*

# --- build output ---
**/dist/
**/dist-ssr/
**/.next/
**/out/
**/build/
**/.turbo/

# --- env / secrets (never upload these) ---
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# --- vercel ---
**/.vercel/

# --- parked / stale git repos ---
**/.git_parked/

# --- editor / claude local ---
.claude/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea/

# --- OS junk ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# --- logs ---
**/*.log
**/npm-debug.log*
**/yarn-debug.log*
**/yarn-error.log*
**/pnpm-debug.log*

# --- typescript build info ---
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/next-env.d.ts
